EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I knew you had good instincts,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Even though we lost,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'm inspired by your seeking skills.
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}And there is a prize for the winner!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Here.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Please accept {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} from us!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İçgüdülerinin iyi olduğunu
biliyordum, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Kaybetmiş olsak da{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
arama yeteneğinden ilham aldım.
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Kazanana da bir ödül var!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Al.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Lütfen {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} bizden kabul et!
